cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Verification code: thin-Schur closures of Cayley graphs"
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic verification code for the paper "Thin-Schur closures of
  Cayley graphs: positive circulant regimes, a minimal abelian counterexample,
  and its census". Reproduces every computational claim in the paper: the
  positive walk-separation results, the wedge witnesses, the Bannai-Muzychuk
  cardinality gap, the minimal counterexample over Z4 x Z8 with its stall
  certificate, and the exhaustive minimality scan and census.
type: software
